WEBVTT

00:01.600 --> 00:04.310
If there were more healers like you, kid,

00:04.640 --> 00:07.570
the world might be a better place.

00:08.970 --> 00:13.070
<i>I feel like he's getting
a little ahead of himself.</i>

00:13.680 --> 00:18.080
I'm going to prohibit you from 
leaving during your training.

00:18.080 --> 00:19.140
You good with that?

00:19.140 --> 00:20.240
What?!

00:21.290 --> 00:24.500
<i>So basically, I'll be trapped here 
until I complete my training?</i>

00:22.540 --> 00:24.500
<b>Mad Dash</b>

00:24.500 --> 00:28.190
<i>But it's not like I have anywhere
else to train if I turn him down...</i>

00:30.340 --> 00:33.130
C-Can we make it a one-month commitment?

00:34.430 --> 00:35.340
Fine by me.

00:36.020 --> 00:39.720
I want you to realize 
how useful you are here.

00:39.720 --> 00:42.310
Then please work with me 
for the next month.

00:42.690 --> 00:47.980
You got it. For a month, I'll work you hard 
until you're <i>really</i> ready to train.

00:48.340 --> 00:49.470
Yes, sir!

00:49.470 --> 00:53.420
Er, is it okay to make this kind of deal?

00:53.420 --> 00:55.420
Won't the guild master be upset?

00:55.420 --> 00:59.830
Nah. I've got plenty of authority 
around here. Don't sweat it.

00:59.830 --> 01:01.330
For real?!

01:01.970 --> 01:04.320
I get martial arts training 
and three meals a day?

01:04.320 --> 01:07.290
And there's a good chance my 
other skills will increase, too!

01:10.220 --> 01:12.350
Ya did it, my boy!

01:12.350 --> 01:16.350
This must be the work 
of Monster Luck-sensei!

01:16.350 --> 01:17.180
Hmm?

01:20.490 --> 01:24.740
<b>The Great Cleric</b>

01:21.620 --> 01:24.750
A Salaryman's <b>Path </b>to <b>Surviving Another World</b>

02:49.480 --> 02:52.400
#3 A Talent for Martial Arts

02:54.880 --> 02:55.820
Yeesh!

02:56.130 --> 02:57.210
That's so cold!

02:57.210 --> 02:58.960
Here. Get changed.

02:59.650 --> 03:01.860
Once you're dressed, come to the cafeteria.

03:01.860 --> 03:04.320
Y-Yes, sir.

03:05.170 --> 03:06.290
Phew.

03:06.570 --> 03:10.330
But what about my old clothes?

03:12.210 --> 03:13.100
Gross!

03:14.920 --> 03:16.450
Nanaella-san!

03:16.450 --> 03:18.050
Good work today!

03:18.830 --> 03:22.130
Thank you for treating those adventurers.

03:22.130 --> 03:25.450
Oh, no need to thank me for that.

03:25.920 --> 03:27.830
Anyway, what's up, Nanaella-san?

03:27.830 --> 03:29.730
Brod-san asked me to come.

03:30.180 --> 03:33.370
He told me to wash your 
clothes, Luciel-sama.

03:33.370 --> 03:35.440
<i>What a treat!</i>

03:36.470 --> 03:38.780
No, no! I can't let you do that!

03:38.780 --> 03:39.770
Huh?

03:40.750 --> 03:43.990
You don't want beastfolk touching your things?

03:43.990 --> 03:46.700
No, that's not it! It actually 
makes me really happy!

03:47.200 --> 03:52.260
But I can't let someone as pretty 
as you do that for me, Nanaella-san.

03:58.130 --> 04:00.950
It's okay! Just leave it to me!

04:00.950 --> 04:03.440
B-But it smells so sweaty...

04:03.440 --> 04:07.360
I'll hang it up with the rest of 
the guild laundry tomorrow, okay?

04:07.360 --> 04:10.430
U-Uh, I, um...

04:10.940 --> 04:12.680
Thank you very much!

04:12.680 --> 04:13.500
Of course!

04:14.580 --> 04:18.670
Um, if there's anything I can 
do in return, please let me know.

04:20.680 --> 04:21.870
I'll take care of this!

04:21.870 --> 04:24.340
<i>Take care of this... Take care of this...</i>

04:24.340 --> 04:27.540
<i>I'll find a way to thank you someday.</i>

04:28.960 --> 04:30.230
Can I get one more?

04:30.230 --> 04:31.830
Hey, how'd today go?

04:31.830 --> 04:33.410
It was a disaster!

04:33.410 --> 04:35.420
C'mon, have another drink!

04:35.420 --> 04:36.440
Kid!

04:36.790 --> 04:38.760
Hey. Over here.

04:38.760 --> 04:40.380
Y-Yes, sir!

04:42.840 --> 04:45.550
<i>This reminds me of office get-togethers.</i>

04:50.300 --> 04:52.190
Is there going to be a party?

04:52.190 --> 04:54.310
This is all for you to eat.

04:54.310 --> 04:56.480
Huh?! All by myself?

04:56.480 --> 04:59.020
You can take your time, but finish it off.

05:00.250 --> 05:02.270
When you're done,
come back to the basement.

05:03.640 --> 05:06.130
<i>I guess this is part of my training...</i>

05:07.410 --> 05:08.840
Thanks for the food!

05:16.370 --> 05:18.330
Oh, yum!

05:24.330 --> 05:26.380
Now <i>that</i> was a meal!

05:29.390 --> 05:31.260
Starting today, you can use this room.

05:31.700 --> 05:33.200
Be sure to get enough rest.

05:33.200 --> 05:34.650
U-Um...

05:35.620 --> 05:38.230
Will there be others who need healing?

05:38.770 --> 05:42.620
Yeah. But starting tomorrow, 
you're gonna be busy.

05:42.620 --> 05:43.650
Okay!

05:45.290 --> 05:48.260
In that case, I'll get 
plenty of sleep for tomorrow.

05:48.670 --> 05:50.070
Good night!

05:55.290 --> 05:57.710
I'm not sleepy at all yet!

05:57.710 --> 05:59.920
What time is it even?

05:59.920 --> 06:04.920
J-Just seven o'clock?! How could any 
modern man go to bed this early?!

06:07.690 --> 06:09.520
Since I can't sleep anyway,

06:09.520 --> 06:13.020
maybe I should work on mastering
my skills to boost my levels.

06:13.640 --> 06:16.270
Okay! Time for a late shift!

06:16.600 --> 06:18.270
Stretch, stretch.

06:19.170 --> 06:20.050
Heal.

06:20.520 --> 06:22.270
<b>Meditation</b>

06:22.270 --> 06:24.140
Stretch, stretch.

06:24.140 --> 06:25.180
Heal.

06:28.630 --> 06:30.380
Wake up! It's chow time!

06:32.270 --> 06:36.910
During your training, you'll take meals 
here in the cafeteria, just like yesterday.

06:36.910 --> 06:37.940
Yes, sir!

06:38.250 --> 06:41.000
Hey, Gulgar. This is Luciel.

06:41.000 --> 06:43.350
Oh, so you're the one.

06:41.000 --> 06:44.710
Gulgar

06:43.350 --> 06:45.210
I'm Gulgar.

06:45.210 --> 06:48.060
My cooking is the best!

06:48.060 --> 06:48.970
<i>A bear?!</i>

06:49.290 --> 06:52.510
Pleased to meet you.
Thanks for looking after me.

06:52.510 --> 06:54.180
Yeah! Nice to meet ya.

06:54.180 --> 06:59.140
F-Forgive me for asking, 
but what's your race?

06:59.140 --> 07:02.860
As you can see, I'm a proud wolffolk!

07:03.860 --> 07:05.110
<i>I've been tricked!</i>

07:06.640 --> 07:10.510
Anyhow, this drink is disgusting,

07:10.510 --> 07:14.070
but the Sage of Time created it 
and it's great for you.

07:14.070 --> 07:17.790
<i>That color sure doesn't </i>look<i> good for you.</i>

07:17.790 --> 07:21.250
Drinking it makes your
muscle strength, endurance,

07:19.250 --> 07:19.750
MUSCLE

07:19.750 --> 07:20.250
ENDURANCE

07:20.250 --> 07:21.250
REACTION TIME

07:21.250 --> 07:24.330
reaction time, and other things
easier to improve.

07:24.330 --> 07:25.750
The effect lasts...

07:25.750 --> 07:26.880
for six hours.

07:26.880 --> 07:29.470
<i>Wait, what? It's a cheat item!</i>

07:29.880 --> 07:32.430
The only hitch is it tastes like crap.

07:32.760 --> 07:37.650
That's why nobody else wants 
to drink it to get stronger.

07:34.840 --> 07:36.610
He's gonna make him drink it!

07:39.080 --> 07:41.640
Is it really safe to consume?

07:41.640 --> 07:45.360
<i>Judging by the color,
it looks like it'll wreck my guts.</i>

07:45.360 --> 07:47.020
<i>And why's it moving like that?!</i>

07:47.020 --> 07:49.790
<i>Still, it's a cheat item...</i>

07:51.310 --> 07:54.100
<i>Th-The stench is gonna rot my nose off!</i>

07:54.560 --> 07:57.450
<i>But if just drinking this 
makes me stronger...</i>

07:58.380 --> 08:00.660
<i>I, Luciel, shall drink.</i>

08:07.610 --> 08:10.390
<i>Oh yeah, that's bad.</i>

08:10.390 --> 08:12.860
<i>The slimy feel it leaves on my tongue...</i>

08:12.860 --> 08:18.300
<i>The bitter, tangy mix with spicy 
and sour flavors ravaging my mouth...</i>

08:18.300 --> 08:19.560
<i>I know exactly what this is.</i>

08:20.020 --> 08:22.250
<i>Substance X!</i>

08:22.250 --> 08:25.440
<i>X... X... X...</i>

08:25.480 --> 08:30.440
<b>I want to spit it out...</b>

08:31.060 --> 08:32.870
<i>I want to spit it out immediately.</i>

08:33.230 --> 08:35.950
<i>To wash out the inside 
of my mouth with pure water</i>

08:37.910 --> 08:40.410
<i>and inhale fresh, clean air.</i>

08:40.750 --> 08:44.370
<i>But the bear in front of me is 
too scary. I can't spit it out.</i>

08:44.650 --> 08:48.040
<i>If I lose focus even a little, 
I'll black out.</i>

08:48.040 --> 08:52.280
<i>I'll just have to chug it!</i>

08:59.720 --> 09:00.720
Holy...

09:02.600 --> 09:03.560
Whoa!

09:04.690 --> 09:06.550
He drank that crap?

09:06.900 --> 09:09.270
<i>I downed the whole thing...</i>

09:10.200 --> 09:15.590
<i>M-My body feels like it's 
overflowing with energy!</i>

09:15.860 --> 09:18.050
Whoa!

09:18.530 --> 09:20.710
Whoa, whoa, whoa!

09:20.710 --> 09:24.330
Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa... X!

09:24.330 --> 09:25.510
Enough already.

09:25.510 --> 09:27.650
Now eat that meat and go join Brod.

09:27.650 --> 09:28.540
Yes, sir!

09:37.840 --> 09:40.640
I never thought he'd polish this off.

09:40.640 --> 09:41.810
Gross!

09:42.450 --> 09:46.500
Sheesh. This guy's got some guts.

09:47.440 --> 09:52.270
<i>And now, it's been nearly a week 
since I came to the Adventurers' Guild.</i>

10:00.340 --> 10:02.660
You done already? Do you want to die?

10:03.590 --> 10:06.090
Please keep teaching me, Instructor Brod!

10:07.030 --> 10:09.420
All right. Very well.

10:09.420 --> 10:10.670
Let's keep going!

10:11.650 --> 10:13.570
Why does he look so happy?!

10:15.960 --> 10:18.480
Don't let your mind go blank 
while defending!

10:18.480 --> 10:20.640
There's purpose behind each attack!

10:20.640 --> 10:22.430
Watch closely, think, and learn

10:22.740 --> 10:24.510
like your life depends on it!

10:28.110 --> 10:30.930
<i>My life, huh?</i>

10:30.930 --> 10:34.840
<i>When I listen to the instructor's 
abuse... I mean, advice,</i>

10:34.840 --> 10:38.630
<i>I actually feel like 
I can give this all I've got.</i>

10:38.630 --> 10:41.080
<i>He's so great.</i>

10:45.320 --> 10:49.960
<i>Obviously, I'm still an absolute beginner
with a mere week of experience.</i>

10:50.630 --> 10:55.260
<i>The best I can do right now is
keep this up and try to learn.</i>

10:56.370 --> 10:58.090
Instructor Brod,

10:58.090 --> 11:00.430
please let me try that again!

11:00.430 --> 11:01.410
Huh?

11:01.410 --> 11:05.970
K-Kid... forcing a smile while you're 
in that much pain is really creepy.

11:05.970 --> 11:09.850
Laughing helps loosen me up.

11:09.850 --> 11:12.960
But I promise that I will 
eventually land an attack!

11:12.960 --> 11:16.940
Oh? Looks like you still have 
enough energy to talk trash.

11:17.890 --> 11:21.720
Fine with me. I'll work you 
down to the bone today!

11:23.410 --> 11:27.440
<i>Oh no! I feel like I just
opened the gates of hell!</i>

11:27.440 --> 11:28.240
Excuse me.

11:30.370 --> 11:34.920
I heard that you heal people here.
Is it really for free?

11:34.920 --> 11:36.880
<i>A catfolk person!</i>

11:37.340 --> 11:39.970
It is. I'll treat you at no charge.

11:39.970 --> 11:41.830
Where are you injured?

11:42.270 --> 11:44.930
I was bit on the back by a wererat.

11:50.520 --> 11:53.020
I can close the wound with a heal spell,

11:53.020 --> 11:57.840
but since you were bitten,
this could lead to the spread of disease.

11:57.840 --> 12:01.100
If you start to feel ill, 
please visit a doctor.

12:01.100 --> 12:03.080
For now, I'll treat you.

12:03.080 --> 12:03.920
Okay.

12:04.900 --> 12:09.700
O Lord, I offer up my magic
so that I may mend this wound.

12:09.700 --> 12:10.910
Heal!

12:18.690 --> 12:21.300
Okay! That should do it.

12:28.840 --> 12:30.460
<i>Wait, what?</i>

12:30.460 --> 12:32.980
<i>Did I say something wrong?</i>

12:32.980 --> 12:35.190
Hey, healer.

12:35.190 --> 12:37.060
Yes? No, I wasn't teasing her!

12:37.700 --> 12:39.020
What's your name?

12:39.020 --> 12:40.980
I-I'm Luciel.

12:42.290 --> 12:46.320
Looks like you'll use your magic
even on us beastfolk, Luciel.

12:50.010 --> 12:53.770
Humans and beastfolk alike,
you're all patients to me.

12:54.870 --> 12:58.010
Luciel, you're a pretty good guy.

12:58.470 --> 13:01.460
Can we come back if we get injured again?

13:01.460 --> 13:03.550
Yeah. Anytime.

13:03.550 --> 13:04.680
Luciel!

13:05.800 --> 13:07.190
Thank you!

13:08.010 --> 13:10.100
I'll come see you if I get hurt again!

13:10.100 --> 13:12.210
S-Sure!

13:17.300 --> 13:19.360
Still, I can't believe you're doing it.

13:19.360 --> 13:20.250
What?

13:20.250 --> 13:21.870
You know, training.

13:21.870 --> 13:24.800
That dude turns into
a totally different person.

13:24.800 --> 13:25.990
I guess.

13:26.740 --> 13:31.110
We adventurers all avoid 
training with Brod-san.

13:31.690 --> 13:34.920
<i>Why couldn't someone 
have told me that sooner?</i>

13:36.170 --> 13:38.080
Thank you for the meal!

13:38.720 --> 13:39.910
Now then,

13:39.910 --> 13:42.170
you want to get strong quickly, right?

13:42.170 --> 13:45.170
<i>There it is! Substance X!</i>

13:45.660 --> 13:48.640
<i>"Disgusting" doesn't even begin to cover it.</i>

13:49.150 --> 13:53.150
<i>Even if it makes me stronger, I wish 
they'd give me a break with that stuff.</i>

13:55.480 --> 13:57.260
<i>What was that all about?</i>

13:57.630 --> 13:58.350
Huh?

14:00.910 --> 14:01.690
Hmm?!

14:05.760 --> 14:07.860
<i>I feel like I'm being watched.</i>

14:09.670 --> 14:12.550
I train from seven in the morning
to seven at night.

14:13.200 --> 14:15.640
I have three huge meals a day.

14:15.640 --> 14:19.350
Then at night, I practice 
my magic control and handling.

14:20.220 --> 14:23.040
I'm getting used to this routine.

14:23.660 --> 14:27.120
With assess mastery, I can tell 
 I'm actually improving.

14:27.730 --> 14:33.150
This might actually be a pretty
fulfilling lifestyle for me.

14:33.750 --> 14:37.950
But still... why were 
those people watching me?

14:44.110 --> 14:46.380
What'd you want to talk about, kid?

14:46.830 --> 14:51.660
It feels like a bunch of people 
are watching me recently.

14:51.660 --> 14:52.350
Huh?

14:57.700 --> 14:59.790
So you two were behind it after all!

14:59.790 --> 15:02.470
Why am I under surveillance?

15:02.970 --> 15:06.380
Sorry! Everyone's worried 
you might run away.

15:07.330 --> 15:08.450
Run away?

15:09.060 --> 15:13.970
Most people trying to become 
adventurers weren't born into wealth.

15:13.970 --> 15:17.840
So they take on risky requests
and pay the price.

15:18.730 --> 15:22.610
But even though they get hurt,
without any money to live on,

15:22.610 --> 15:26.610
they keep forcing themselves
to take on dangerous requests.

15:27.850 --> 15:29.350
<i>I get it.</i>

15:29.350 --> 15:33.100
<i>As long as I'm here, they 
can get their injuries treated</i>

15:33.100 --> 15:35.120
<i>and go right back out to work.</i>

15:36.120 --> 15:41.090
<i>Without realizing it, the adventurers' 
fate has been left in my hands.</i>

15:43.490 --> 15:46.800
Anyway, I agreed to stay for a month,

15:47.550 --> 15:50.940
so until that's up, give me some credit
and call off the watch.

15:52.430 --> 15:53.390
Very well.

15:53.390 --> 15:55.540
I'm being serious here, okay?

15:55.540 --> 15:58.100
The next time I catch someone watching me,

15:58.100 --> 16:02.060
I'll drag them here and make them 
drink <i>that</i> with me, got it?

16:06.020 --> 16:09.530
Of course, since you're in charge, 
I'll make you drink it too, Brod.

16:11.430 --> 16:15.190
<i>And so, the month started flying by.</i>

16:15.740 --> 16:17.580
<i>Though something interesting happened...</i>

16:19.540 --> 16:20.870
Meow, Luciel!

16:21.530 --> 16:24.670
Thanks for healing me before. 
I'll be counting on you next time too.

16:24.670 --> 16:26.330
Sure! No problem.

16:26.840 --> 16:29.800
<i>More people have started talking to me.</i>

16:29.800 --> 16:33.400
<i>I hope this helps me get 
accustomed to adventurers.</i>

16:34.550 --> 16:38.220
<i>Then there's my all-important training.</i>

16:41.680 --> 16:43.980
<i>I've started doing more target practice.</i>

16:43.980 --> 16:45.980
Kid! Get serious about this!

16:45.980 --> 16:46.940
Yes, sir!

16:47.280 --> 16:50.440
<i>I thought my baseball 
experience would pay off,</i>

16:50.910 --> 16:55.470
<i>but at this rate, I have to wonder when 
he'll let me throw real weapons.</i>

16:56.030 --> 16:59.020
<i>Yup. It's dawned on me that
even when my month is up,</i>

16:59.420 --> 17:02.670
<i>I still won't have mastered anything.</i>

17:03.830 --> 17:07.710
<i>Realistically, I have a long way to go
before I'm fit for fighting outside.</i>

17:08.590 --> 17:11.300
<i>But I've made up my mind... for now...</i>

17:11.300 --> 17:13.960
For now, patience can cook a stone!

17:13.960 --> 17:15.970
What the hell are you excited for?!

17:15.970 --> 17:17.290
You missed every single one!

17:17.290 --> 17:18.460
I got one, though!

17:18.460 --> 17:19.950
Don't you talk back to me!

17:19.950 --> 17:21.260
Sir!

17:23.020 --> 17:26.770
<i>My portions of Substance X got bigger,</i>

17:27.340 --> 17:29.730
<i>I got more healing requests...</i>

17:30.410 --> 17:32.810
<i>And the last day of my contract finally came.</i>

17:33.190 --> 17:36.100
You really worked hard this month.

17:36.100 --> 17:39.030
Under your guidance. 
Thank you so much for everything.

17:39.030 --> 17:42.020
Now I'll go back to the Healers' 
Guild to look for work.

17:42.020 --> 17:44.410
When I've saved up enough money, 
please train me again.

17:44.410 --> 17:45.820
Money?

17:46.440 --> 17:49.880
That's right.
You said you were basically broke.

17:49.880 --> 17:54.530
That's right. I have to pay my offering 
to the Healers' Guild.

17:54.530 --> 17:56.720
What would you do if you <i>did</i> have money?

17:56.720 --> 17:57.680
What?

17:57.680 --> 18:02.010
For example, if someone gave you 
the money for a year's offering?

18:02.840 --> 18:04.850
I don't know...

18:05.340 --> 18:09.100
If it'd be all right, 
I'd like to train with you more.

18:10.740 --> 18:15.650
This is for making it through a month of 
training and saving those adventurers' lives.

18:15.650 --> 18:17.010
A reward!

18:17.010 --> 18:18.230
Take it.

18:18.230 --> 18:19.810
Yes... sir.

18:22.370 --> 18:24.490
Huh? This much?!

18:24.490 --> 18:28.590
Twelve silver coins.
Use that and go pay your offering.

18:30.930 --> 18:34.890
Thanks to you, the death rate 
for adventurers has dropped sharply.

18:35.420 --> 18:37.550
Consider it a special bonus.

18:37.550 --> 18:40.610
But this is a lot of money, isn't it?

18:40.610 --> 18:41.810
I can't possibly accept...

18:41.810 --> 18:43.160
Just take it.

18:44.150 --> 18:46.690
Your martial arts skill is still infantile.

18:47.090 --> 18:50.140
So starting today, you'll keep on training.

18:51.140 --> 18:54.860
If you're on board, then go pay up.

18:56.970 --> 18:58.080
Understood.

18:58.490 --> 19:01.350
I'll gladly accept this and pay my fees.

19:01.350 --> 19:03.320
Be sure to come back, okay?

19:03.320 --> 19:05.700
We'll be waiting for you, Luciel.

19:06.700 --> 19:08.680
Yeah! I'll definitely be back!

19:12.670 --> 19:15.920
That will cover your offering for one year.

19:15.920 --> 19:18.970
But are you sure about doing this?

19:18.970 --> 19:25.030
If you get promoted within the year,
you'll be assessed an additional offering.

19:25.030 --> 19:26.330
I'm sure.

19:27.130 --> 19:29.200
For now, instead of ranking up,

19:29.200 --> 19:32.350
I need to focus on becoming strong 
enough to become independent.

19:32.350 --> 19:37.390
Well, it certainly does take
a lot of funds to open a clinic.

19:37.390 --> 19:40.280
When I've earned enough, 
I'll come for my promotion.

19:40.280 --> 19:43.710
All right. Keep up the good work, okay?

19:49.950 --> 19:51.660
I'm glad you came back.

19:51.660 --> 19:55.080
Um, were you waiting here for me?

19:57.590 --> 20:01.510
I-I just happened to be passing through.

20:01.960 --> 20:04.810
Nanaella, do you have 
the kid's adventurer card?

20:04.810 --> 20:06.450
Yes, right here.

20:06.450 --> 20:07.770
Renew it for me.

20:07.770 --> 20:09.360
Understood!

20:10.100 --> 20:12.690
Don't you need my permission to do that?!

20:12.690 --> 20:15.540
Okay, no need to worry about the contract now!

20:15.540 --> 20:17.150
Hey! Instructor Brod!

20:17.150 --> 20:18.530
Do your best, okay?

20:18.530 --> 20:20.150
Somebody help!

20:20.150 --> 20:25.560
<i>Nobody's even lifting a finger!</i>

20:28.830 --> 20:30.540
Thank you for the meal.

20:30.540 --> 20:32.060
<i>All right, all right, all right!</i>

20:30.540 --> 20:35.750
<b>All right,
all right,
all right!</b>

20:30.540 --> 20:35.750
<b>W
A
A
A
H</b>

20:32.060 --> 20:35.750
<i>Today's training felt even harder than usual.</i>

20:36.410 --> 20:37.650
Hey, kid.

20:37.650 --> 20:38.510
Yes?

20:38.510 --> 20:39.750
This is for you.

20:42.500 --> 20:45.510
<i>Encyclopedia of Low-Level Holy Magic</i>?

20:46.140 --> 20:47.470
Is this a spell tome?

20:47.470 --> 20:48.780
Yup.

20:48.780 --> 20:51.090
A treat for coming home on time.

20:51.090 --> 20:52.600
Do you think I'm a child?

20:54.190 --> 20:57.950
Healers need the recovery spell heal 
and the detoxification spell cure.

20:58.480 --> 21:01.610
Once you can cast both, you'll be
on your way to becoming the real deal.

21:01.980 --> 21:04.530
You can only use heal now, can't you?

21:04.530 --> 21:07.300
So read that book and study up.

21:15.240 --> 21:16.650
What's so damn funny?!

21:16.650 --> 21:20.210
<i>Wha—? Is Brod actually
a sweetie underneath it all?</i>

21:24.100 --> 21:26.130
Instructor, thank you very much.

21:27.010 --> 21:30.390
Starting again today, I will try 
my very best, so please train me more!

21:32.680 --> 21:33.560
Sure.

21:33.980 --> 21:35.990
Heya, kid!

21:35.990 --> 21:38.730
If you're gonna work your hardest, 
drink up beforehand!

21:38.730 --> 21:40.570
Substance X!

21:40.570 --> 21:43.270
Finish that off and let's 
get to afternoon training!

21:43.270 --> 21:45.530
Come drink it with me, Instructor Brod!

21:45.950 --> 21:49.240
I don't need it. 
I'll be waiting for you!

21:49.240 --> 21:50.970
C'mon, kid!

21:54.330 --> 21:55.650
All right.

22:05.510 --> 22:07.910
<i>This really is disgusting!</i>

22:07.910 --> 22:11.510
<i>Damn that Brod! For this...</i>

22:11.830 --> 22:16.520
<i>I swear I'll knock you out in the next year!</i>

22:13.260 --> 22:16.520
I got super tough!

22:18.500 --> 22:20.020
Thank you very much!

22:20.720 --> 22:24.500
<i>Now the </i>real<i> training begins!</i>

23:55.410 --> 23:57.910
Hey, guys! What did you think of my cooking?

23:57.910 --> 24:00.460
Mountains of delicious grub!
Sounds like a dream, right?

24:00.460 --> 24:02.750
Luciel even drank <i>that</i>...

24:02.750 --> 24:04.750
Phew! That surprised me!

24:04.750 --> 24:07.240
Next time: "Substance X and a Small Change."

24:04.920 --> 24:09.920
#4 Substance X and a Small Change

24:07.240 --> 24:09.880
If ya don't watch it, 
you're getting Substance X!
